{"query":"Paradigm Anantaara - Shimpoli, Borivali (W)  official site amenities","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://www.anantaaraparadigm.co.in","title":"Luxury Living at Paradigm Anantaara | PARADIGM ANANTAARA","content":"Paradigm Anantaara, situated near Simpoli Ground in Borivali West, offers a life of luxury, comfort, and convenience. Here, you'll experience a harmonious blend of contemporary living and a serene environment. This residential haven is your gateway to a lifestyle you've always dreamed of.\n\nInvest in your future, invest in Paradigm Anantaara. Experience the epitome of luxury living in Borivali West. Make the move today and redefine your living experience.\n\nDon't miss the chance to become a part of this extraordinary community. Contact us now to learn more about availability and pricing at Paradigm Anantaara near Simpoli Ground, Borivali West. Your dream home awaits!\n\n​\n\n## AMENITIES: PARADIGM ANANTAARA . ANANDA PARK . SHIMPOLI . BORIVALI WEST . MUMBAI . [...] Paradigm Anantaara offers world-class amenities for a complete lifestyle:\n\nFully equipped fitness center\n\nLandscaped garden & seating areas\n\nKids’ play area\n\nIndoor games zone\n\nMultipurpose hall\n\nHigh-speed elevators\n\n24x7 security with CCTV surveillance\n\nAmple car parking spaces\n\nDesigner entrance lobby\n\nRainwater harvesting & sustainable features [...] PARADIGM ANANTAARA logo\nPARADIGM ANANTAARA logo\nANANTAARA BORIVALI, PARADIGM ANANTAARA SHIMPOLI BORIVALI WEST\nANANTAARA BORIVALI, PARADIGM ANANTAARA SHIMPOLI BORIVALI WEST\n\nWelcome To Paradigm Anantaara . Shimpoli . Borivali East\n\nCall: +91 9920484744\n\nOr Fill In The Form Below\n\n\\Artist images\n\n# ABOUT: PARADIGM ANANTAARA . ANANDA PARK . SHIMPOLI . BORIVALI WEST . MUMBAI .\n\nIntroduction: Nestled in the heart of Borivali West, Mumbai, Paradigm Anantaara is a haven of luxury and tranquility that promises an exceptional lifestyle. This elegantly crafted residential complex is strategically located near Simpoli Ground, offering a perfect blend of modern amenities and serene surroundings. Here, you will find a sanctuary of comfort and style that redefines urban living.\n\n​","score":0.86108357,"raw_content":null,"id":"cd0653-00"},{"url":"https://rezide.in/project/66bf14598f7fbb55ff31f116","title":"Paradigm Anantaara | Shimpoli | Borivali West - Rezide","content":"Project Amenities · Adult Swimming Pool · BBQ Area · CCTV · Double Heighted Lobby · Fitness Centre · Gymnasium · Indoor Children play area · Indoor Games room.","score":0.8335554,"raw_content":null,"id":"3ae783-01"},{"url":"https://www.propjunction.in/projects/paradigm-anantaara","title":"Paradigm Anantaara at Shimpoli, Borivali West, Mumbai","content":"## Overview\n\nParadigm Anantaara is a timeless elegant residential epitome at Shimpoli, Borivali West in Mumbai with splendid 2, 3, & 4-bedroom apartments by Paradigm Realty. Welcome to the contemporary spaces that deliver the immaculate and exceptional living needs of families. Witness the panoramic 360-degree vistas of the national park, the flowing Gorai Creek, & the Pagoda. Access the bespoke lifestyle at comfortable homes and world-class amenities within this artfully derived architectural masterpiece.\n\nThis 42-storey rising cornerstone is the premium living benchmark of the community. With innovative detailing and subtly carved sophistication, it’s a branded gem that adorns the open skyline amidst the lush landscapes of the community. [...] The Aura Sky facilities are exclusively incorporated for its elite inhabitants. The breathtaking viewing deck with plunging up in the infinity pool is an expensive leisure for people. Based on the global metropolis, this rooftop area aims to deliver a soothing quality indulgence with the feeling of serenity and relaxation. At 475 ft above the ground, this amenity caters to the modern desires and luxurious convenience of the inhabitants.\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n## Thank You for your enquiry ! We will get back to you shortly...\n\nPlease wait...\n\n### Get in touch with us!\n\n## Amenities\n\nTons of attractions and facilities at services for an enhanced lifestyle.\n\n## Price List\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n## 6 Bedrooms\n\n6 BHK, Unit 3 & 4\nFloor Plan\n\n## 5 Bedrooms\n\n5.5 BHK, Unit 7 & 8\nFloor Plan\n\n## 3 Bedrooms [...] Find your heaven-like sanctuary at the master-planned home address of Anantaara Paradigm in Shimpoli at Borivali West. This 42-storey majestic tower features extravagant living spaces and thoughtfully designed additional areas with premium quality facilities. The Club Saint Tropez podium on the 10th floor and the Aura Sky rooftop amenity centre are prestigious spaces brimming with world-class facilities catering to the needs and utmost leisure of every age group of residents.\n\nParadigm Anantaara Master Plan\n\n## Project Gallery\n\nCafeteria\nInfinity Pool\nIndoor Games\nLobby\nWell Equipped Gym\nRetail Lifestyle\nMaster Bedroom\nWide Open Window\nKids Playing Area\nAmazing View\nTrue Family Living\nEntrance\n\n## Similar Projects\n\nParadigm Artteza\n\nSantacruz West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 & 4 BHK","score":0.8232293,"raw_content":null,"id":"7047fd-02"},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/paradigm-anantara","title":"Paradigm Anantaara Borivali West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","content":"This project offers 19+ amenities. Key external amenities include Mini Theatre, Sun Deck, Walking Track, party lawn, and Indoor games. Internal","score":0.7837407,"raw_content":null,"id":"89f175-03"},{"url":"https://paradigmrealty.co.in/projects/paradigm-anantaara","title":"Paradigm Anantaara | 2 & 3 BHK in Borivali West, Mumbai","content":"Amenities · Rooftop Party Area · Swimming Pool · Kids Play Area · Indoor Games · Double-height Entrance Lobby · Grande Drop-off Lobby","score":0.7813477,"raw_content":null,"id":"ad400e-04"},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/paradigm-anantaara-khar-west/28509","title":"Para